    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="24">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 24</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man preost ofslea, forgilde man hine be fullan were 7 biscope feower 7 XX ór to weofodbote; æt diacone XII ór to weofodbote.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If anyone slays a priest, he is to pay compensation for him with the full wergild, and 24 ores to the bishop as compensation for [insult to] the altar; for a deacon 12 ores as compensation for [insult to] the altar.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone kills a priest, compensate for him with his full wergild, and twenty-four ores to the bishop as compensation to the church; for a deacon, twelve ores as compensation to the church.</ab>
      </div>
